WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.200
Several projects are
under way in Nouadhibou

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.300
to build and renovate schools and health
facilities, funded by the state budget.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.500
Some of these projects have
made significant progress,

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.600
as part of efforts to develop
education and health infrastructure.

5
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.000
Work is continuing in
Nouadhibou on several

6
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.400
major infrastructure development projects,

7
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.200
covering education, vocational
training and health,

8
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.300
as part of efforts to
improve public facilities

9
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.400
and the quality of services for citizens.

10
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.500
One of the most important is the
new School of Technical Education

11
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.700
and Vocational Training in ICT,

12
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.400
overseen by the Ministry of
Housing and Urban Planning,

13
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.900
at a total cost of over
1.7 billion old ouguiyas,

14
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.600
funded by the state budget. The
works are carried out by SOBAFOR.

15
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:06.500
The project includes a range of
essential facilities and equipment

16
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:11.100
to provide complete teaching
and training infrastructure

17
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:17.500
meeting the needs of technical
and vocational training in ICT

18
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:21.200
and helping to develop specialised skills.

19
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:28.900
This project has 9 classrooms,
22 teachers' offices,

20
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:36.900
16 administrative offices,
a 150-seat lecture theatre,

21
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.600
a 300-seat canteen,

22
00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:48.200
two staff residences and student housing:

23
00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:53.800
the boys' residence has 42 rooms, two
of them for people with disabilities,

24
00:01:53.900 --> 00:02:00.400
and the girls' residence also has 42
rooms, two for people with disabilities.

25
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:06.100
The project is currently 60% complete.

26
00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:10.050
These projects reflect
the State's commitment

27
00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:12.650
to developing Nouadhibou's infrastructure

28
00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:16.350
and strengthening its education
and health facilities,

29
00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:22.850
to meet the population's growing
needs in these two vital sectors.

30
00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:28.050
Cheikh Ould Ahmeidi,
El Mouritaniya, Nouadhibou.
